v 3
d mdf — the Master DO File survey pipeline framework
d
d Turns raw SurveyCTO exports into a managed survey-processing pipeline:
d builds the project tree, imports and archives data, applies CAPI value
d labels, runs High-Frequency Checks, manages open-ended translation,
d optionally merges paired datasets.
d
d A project's Master_DO_File.do carries only Section 0 (the switches) and
d the list of pipeline stages. Everything under the hood is installed from
d here.
d
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer.
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260928
d Author: Adin Khan
d Support: https://github.com/adinkhan7/master-do-file
